  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only ticker deep dive 🔒 </strong>This pick originated in one of my weekly mid-week stock market reviews. Each week I take viewer’s ticker requests and rank them from worst to first. Many of these top picks have performed well, the most recent AS, rocketing +23% in less than a week!</em></p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@economyandstocks\">Timothy’s TikTok</a></strong> <strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div><hr></div><p><em><strong>This stock has an 87% structural match to Palantir </strong></em><span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;PLTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. </p><p>We covered Palantir in 2024, <strong>before</strong> it ran an additional 204%. And one of the stocks from our most recent <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/mid-week-movers-ford-stockor-lucid?r=4z8lgl\">Mid-Week Movers from 20th of May</a>…I just kept circling back to. You trade enough charts over 18 years, and you pick up on clues and patterns, ahead of time. <strong>Sensing another Palantir</strong>, I asked ChatGPT to tell me, what was the % match structurally of the 2 charts. I intentionally left the tickers, names of the companies and even the prices out of the image, to prevent any biases. I also left out Palantir’s massive parabolic run…because I wanted to know the percent match BEFORE the run. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BSD2!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf49364d-14b7-4acb-8a6d-8e6361a1d919_752x396.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BSD2!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf49364d-14b7-4acb-8a6d-8e6361a1d919_752x396.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BSD2!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf49364d-14b7-4acb-8a6d-8e6361a1d919_752x396.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BSD2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf49364d-14b7-4acb-8a6d-8e6361a1d919_752x396.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BSD2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf49364d-14b7-4acb-8a6d-8e6361a1d919_752x396.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BSD2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf49364d-14b7-4acb-8