idth=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">As suspected…the match was incredibly close. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Now, we cannot expect a 100% match. But 87%? Thats not something to ignore. <em><strong>Its really about when and where to enter at, so here is the game plan 🧑🏻‍💻 </strong></em>(Note: this is a stock I intend to accumulate over time, for more than a year…ie, great for long term investors)</p><p>To read more, <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p>",
